    "description_mirror": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "What would you build if you had a dedicated evening to experiment with Claude and Granola?",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Join us at Granola SF for a hackathon for ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "GTM and Marketing operators",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
            },
            { "text": "!", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "No technical background needed. We’re bringing together a curated group of GTM and Marketing leaders to use your Granola context with our MCP, build with Claude, and explore how AI can change the way we work and build something useful along the way.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "You’ll get Claude API credits to build with on the night, before sharing what you’ve made and putting it to our judges. Come with an idea, a problem you want to solve or just some curiosity.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "horizontal_rule" },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Schedule",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    { "text": "Doors open at ", "type": "text" },
                    {
                      "text": "5.30pm",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    { "text": "Arrive by ", "type": "text" },
                    {
                      "text": "6pm",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    { "text": "Demos by ", "type": "text" },
                    {
                      "text": "8pm",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list_item",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    { "text": "Wrap up by ", "type": "text" },
                    {
                      "text": "8.30pm!",
                      "type": "text",
                      "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Places are limited and we expect this to be heavily oversubscribed, so apply early if you'd like to join us.",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [{ "type": "italic" }]
            }
          ]
        }
